#: ../../../reference/interfaces/mpris-interface.md:0
msgid ""
"Reference documentation for the mpris interface, which lets snaps control "
"media players through the Media Player Remote Interfacing Specification."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/interfaces/mpris-interface.md:8
msgid "mpris interface"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/interfaces/mpris-interface.md:10
msgid ""
"`mpris` enables access to the Media Player Remote Interfacing Specification "
"(mpris) via DBus, allowing a snap to control music and video players."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/interfaces/mpris-interface.md:12
msgid ""
"This interface is most commonly used to pass media key control through to a "
"media player, such as _play_ and _pause_ and music playback."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/interfaces/mpris-interface.md:14
msgid ""
"Consuming snaps can access media players implementing mpris via the "
"providing snap's well-known DBus name."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/interfaces/mpris-interface.md:16
msgid "**Auto-Connect**: no</br> **Attributes**:</br>"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/interfaces/mpris-interface.md:16
msgid "</br>"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/interfaces/mpris-interface.md:18
msgid ""
"`name` (slot): optional, media player name to use for DBus well-known name   "
"(ie, `org.mpris.MediaPlayer2.$name`). If omitted, use the snap's name."
msgstr ""
